{"knowledge_id": "K-CHILI-0101", "process_id": "chili", "kind": "disease", "title": "辣椒青枯病与枯萎病的鉴别判据", "content": "青枯病：叶片仍保持绿色却急速萎蔫，切开茎秆可见维管束变黄褐，挤压切口渗出乳白色菌脓（俗称菌脓）；枯萎病：植株逐渐黄化萎蔫，切开茎秆无菌脓流出，维管束变色并可见蓝白色霉状物。两病的关键区别在于挤压切口有无乳白色菌脓，这一鉴别点在家即可操作。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "专项调研 2024; 与 chili.yaml decisive_features 对齐"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-CHILI-0102", "process_id": "chili", "kind": "disease", "title": "辣椒青枯病发生条件", "content": "青枯病为细菌性土传病害，高温高湿、土壤偏酸、连作田块易发，病菌从根部伤口侵入，一旦发病蔓延迅速。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "专项调研 2024"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-CHILI-0103", "process_id": "chili", "kind": "disease", "title": "辣椒枯萎病发生条件", "content": "枯萎病为真菌性土传病害，病菌在土壤中可长期存活，连作、土壤黏重、排水不良的田块发病重。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "专项调研 2024"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-CHILI-0104", "process_id": "chili", "kind": "cultivation", "title": "辣椒土传病害的土壤层面处置", "content": "土传病害重点在土壤层面处置：开沟排水降低地下水位，与非茄科作物轮作三年以上，高温闷棚或土壤消毒处理，酸性土适量施用石灰调节 pH。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "专项调研 2024"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-CHILI-0105", "process_id": "chili", "kind": "pesticide", "title": "春雷霉素防治辣椒青枯病", "content": "春雷霉素用于防治辣椒青枯病，发病初期灌根，连灌 2 至 3 次，间隔 7 至 10 天。", "pesticide_name": "春雷霉素", "registered_crops": ["辣椒"], "dosage_min": 30.0, "dosage_max": 50.0, "dosage_unit": "毫升/亩", "safety_interval_days": 7, "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "登记标签"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-CHILI-0106", "process_id": "chili", "kind": "pesticide", "title": "噁霉灵防治辣椒枯萎病", "content": "噁霉灵用于防治辣椒枯萎病，播前土壤处理或发病初期灌根。", "pesticide_name": "噁霉灵", "registered_crops": ["辣椒"], "dosage_min": 20.0, "dosage_max": 30.0, "dosage_unit": "毫升/亩", "safety_interval_days": 7, "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "登记标签"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-CHILI-0107", "process_id": "chili", "kind": "pesticide", "title": "嘧菌酯防治辣椒炭疽病", "content": "嘧菌酯用于防治辣椒炭疽病，在发病初期喷雾，注意与不同作用机理药剂轮换。", "pesticide_name": "嘧菌酯", "registered_crops": ["辣椒"], "dosage_min": 30.0, "dosage_max": 40.0, "dosage_unit": "毫升/亩", "safety_interval_days": 7, "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "登记标签"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-CHILI-0108", "process_id": "chili", "kind": "threshold", "title": "辣椒青枯病发病率处置指标", "content": "田间青枯病发病率达 5% 时，应结合排水与药剂灌根处置，并同步排查灌溉水源是否被病菌污染。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "专项调研 2024"}
